Z||000000||Master_Sushi||10-02-2001||11:45 AM||||Well 88 coupe will be gone in a little over a week. It was my first "real" car. Its kind of sad to see it go. I've spent so much time working on it, and upgrading it. I still have one fiero left, im going to sell it in the spring though. Thats assuming it makes it through the winter, lol. I will probably buy a really nice GT some day when I have the money and space to own more then one car. Anyway, I'm going to probably get a 4 seater with a real trunk in a few months. I'm looking at either 3.4L DOHC luminas or MK3 supras right now. Im geting off topic now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.<P>Well this is the last time I'll be using my fiero signature! Sad sad  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>88 Fiero Coupe...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mesopotamis_1.jpg"> ||||reg||9
