Z||000004||Master_Sushi||10-02-2001||07:35 PM||||I really hated to sell it. I did it for a few reasons though. Mostly because im really short on cash and I have no job at the moment. Also I want a biger car, and a back seat  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. Something a bit faster then ten seconds 0-60 would be nice also. I was looking at supras and DOHC luminas before I got my fiero. Don't get me wrong though, my fieros been a great car! I still have my black 84SE. I'm going to drive it through the winter.<P>Even when I have no fieros I'll still be here! If I wasn't I know how you'd all miss me so much  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||My7Fieros||10-03-2001||03:40 AM||||So, lemme get this strait...you're wanting a 4 door, a bigger trunk, and a "better 0-60" time car? Umm.....ok  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><BR>Man I dont get it, you just posted something not too long ago about how far you've come along on your Fiero (yes, I remember these posts). I think you'll regret it, but I guess if you hang onto 1 Fiero, thats ok.<BR>Oh yeah, arent you selling it on eBay? Thought I saw it on there...last I saw it had like 3 bids on it. Anyway, if you gotta sell it then sell it, but hang onto the other one!!!!!<P>------------------<BR><FONT SIZE="3"><FONT COLOR="blue"><B><I>My 7 Fieros</FONT></FONT></B></I>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Master_Sushi||10-03-2001||11:43 AM||||Im going to keep my 84 se for sure. Its going to me my winter car for now. I'll probably allways have a fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. Ya my fiero was on ebay and it got 3 bids. I was really happy it finally sold. I wouldn't have sold it if I didn't have to. Some guy from texas is going to buy it next week. Hes going to drive it all the way from western NY to Texas.<P>If anyone sees a mint 88 coupe with nice wheels somewhere between NY and texas give the driver a good wave/honk!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||Fformula88||10-03-2001||12:18 PM||||You don't have to give numbers, but I was wondering if you got about what you were looking for it?  Hope you did since you seemd to really need it... plus it sounded to be in great shape on the ebay add! <P>Its also sad to see another Fiero leaving this area.  There aren't too many left that I have seen out on the roads.  But a Fiero as a winter car in WNY?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif">  j/k... they are ok even with our snow totals, but one just doesn't think of two seater sports cars as winter cars  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
